# Component standards

Extract reusable components. Prefer composition over one-off JSX.

## Design-system shared components

Typography (`Display`, `Title`, `Heading`, `Body`, `BodySm`, `Caption`, `Overline`, `LabelText`)  
SectionHeader · StatusChip · UserAvatar · BrandMark  
AppCard · FormField · SegmentedControl  
EmptyState / LoadingState / ErrorState / LoadingCard  
AppDialog / BottomSheet / AppDrawer  
DataTable · toast helpers

## Feature UI patterns (reuse these)

- `MatchTicket` — Home next-match surface (`features/dashboard`)
- `WeekendDaySection` + `CreateTournamentSheet` — weekend create flow
- Auth: `AuthShell`, `LoginForm`, `OtpForm`
- Team: `TeamMembersView`, `AddPlayerForm` (sheet)

## Rules

- Primitives live in `components/ui` (shadcn).
- Compose higher-level UI in `common` / `cards` / `forms` / `dialogs` / `feedback` / `tables`.
- Display/stat copy must use `font-heading` (Barlow Condensed).
- Selected states on segmented controls use lime accent — do not invent parallel toggles.
- Avoid nesting cards inside cards; prefer tonal sections and hairline dividers.
- Keep feature files under ~250 lines; extract day sections / sheets / tickets.

Reuse before creating new components.
